            <div xml:id="d627">

                <pb facs="0715" n="703" sameAs="frus:frus1943v02/pg703"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">852.6363/984: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Hayes</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-08-05T13:00:00+02:00">August 5, 1943—1
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 2:31 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2035. Your 1411, June 26, 3 p.m., paragraph 5. I am including landing rights for
                    American airlines in Spain as one of conditions for furnishing aviation gas.
                    British Ambassador requests permission for British airlines be included. I
                    assume there is no objection. Please advise.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hayes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
